From: Jay Leaton <58495321+jayleaton@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 20:08:57 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 10/12] flashnext cuda: Engine.initRank names kept (null), so
 an engine made without the server's load frees no garbage spares

flashnext-model-rank and flashnext-fidelity-rank make their engine with initRank alone; rank 1's first kept
state then read an undefined HostSpares (a general protection fault in HostSpares.find).
---
 zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_prompt.zig | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_prompt.zig b/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_prompt.zig
index 50c74a2ab..f74d41360 100644
--- a/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_prompt.zig
+++ b/zig/src/families/flashnext/cuda_prompt.zig
@@ -232,6 +232,7 @@ pub const Engine = struct {
         e.batch_k.native_lane.fuse_split_n = fuse_split_n;
         e.batch_s = null;
         e.scores = null;
+        e.kept = null;
         e.chunk = chunk;
         e.busy_chunk = busy;
         return e;
